        this Tax Invoice.</li>
      <li>It is Buyer responsibility to check content of this Tax Invoice and report damage within 07 days from the
        date of delivery.</li>
      <li>Supplier will exchange damage good within 30 days from date of this Tax Invoice.</li>
      <li>Payment cheques must be in favor of Piercing Systems Pakistan Private Limited.</li>
      <li>If payment is in cash, Buyer must demand Official payment receipt from Supplier or it's representative.</li>
      <li>Buyer is responsible to ensure proper and sufficient insurance against the goods value in case of internal
        loose, theft, or but not limited to other risks known and unknown.</li>
      <li>Delivery charges of Rs500.00 will apply on all Orders under the value of Rs10,000.00</li>
      <li>All Products remains property of Piercing Systems Pakistan Private Limited until paid in full.</li>
      <li>Supplier will process and deliver orders according to Buyers LPO within 07 (Seven) working days.</li>
      <li>Buyer agrees not to hold Supplier responsible for delay of order delivery, unavailability and short supply
