      <li>In the event/s of nonpayment from Buyer within agreed payment terms, Suppliers reserve the rights to stop
        future supply, has right to takeback, uplift stocks to recover outstanding charges from Buyer. Supplier within
        its right will take appropriate legal action to recover outstanding amount from Buyer.</li>
      <li>Piercing Systems Pakistan Private Limited within it's right will report bounce/unpaid cheques to police and
        will take necessary legal action against Buyer.</li>
      <li>In the event of any dispute, the Pakistan Courts shall be competent to hear the dispute.</li>
      <li>In case of cheque bounce for any reason company is authorized to charge 1000/- penalty amount.</li>
